---
/** Illustrative product visual: an after-hours call being booked. Not real customer data. */
---

<figure class="call" aria-label="Illustrative example of an after-hours service call being answered and booked">
  <div class="call__bar">
    <span class="call__live"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Incoming call</span>
    <span class="call__meta">9:42 PM · Dallas, TX</span>
  </div>

  <ol class="call__log">
    <li class="msg msg--caller">
      <span class="msg__who">Caller</span>
      <p>My air conditioning stopped cooling and it’s 94 degrees inside.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="msg msg--ai">
      <span class="msg__who">Assistant</span>
      <p>I’m sorry, that sounds uncomfortable. I can get a technician out. Is anyone in the home elderly or relying on medical equipment?</p>
    </li>
    <li class="msg msg--caller">
      <span class="msg__who">Caller</span>
      <p>My mother is here, she’s 82.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="msg msg--ai">
      <span class="msg__who">Assistant</span>
      <p>Understood, I’ll mark this as priority. The earliest opening is tomorrow at 8 AM. Shall I book it?</p>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <div class="call__result">
    <div>
      <span class="call__tag">Booked · Priority</span>
      <p class="call__what">No cooling · Tue 8:00–10:00 AM</p>
    </div>
    <span class="call__sync">Added to schedule</span>
  </div>

  <figcaption class="call__note">Illustrative example</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .call {
    margin: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(243, 239, 230, 0.06), rgba(243, 239, 230, 0.02));
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 40px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }
  .call__bar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding-bottom: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 13px; }
  .call__live { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .call__live i { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--brass); animation: pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .call__meta { color: var(--fg-muted); }
  .call__log { display: grid; gap: 14px; padding: 22px 0; }
  .msg { max-width: 92%; display: grid; gap: 4px; }
  .msg__who { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--fg-muted); }
  .msg p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; padding: 12px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px 12px 12px 12px; background: rgba(243, 239, 230, 0.04); }
  .msg--ai { margin-left: auto; }
  .msg--ai .msg__who { color: var(--brass); text-align: right; }
  .msg--ai p { border-radius: 12px 4px 12px 12px; border-color: rgba(184, 155, 94, 0.45); background: rgba(184, 155, 94, 0.08); }
  .call__result { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--brass); color: var(--ink); }
  .call__tag { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .call__what { font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 2px; }
  .call__sync { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap; }
  .call__note { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg-muted); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  @keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.3; } }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .call { padding: 18px; }
    .call__result { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px; }
  }
</style>
